            "detailed_description": "HUNGER: <br />\r\n  Computer game in the genre of survival, telling the story of a lonely soldier, abandoned to an unexplored island. People say that there is life on this island and the settlers of this island are building their civilization there. After the discovery of the settlers of this island, it turns out that there is disorder and chaos in the infected world and a threat of extinction has appeared. He was hit by a pandemic, people die from unknown ailments, and some even become bloodthirsty and uncontrollable cannibals. The shamans of several tribes are trying desperately to create a medicine, but without success. Madness and despair have settled in the hearts of people, and in order to survive, they need to forget old grievances and rally in the face of danger.",
            "about_the_game": "HUNGER: <br />\r\n  Computer game in the genre of survival, telling the story of a lonely soldier, abandoned to an unexplored island. People say that there is life on this island and the settlers of this island are building their civilization there. After the discovery of the settlers of this island, it turns out that there is disorder and chaos in the infected world and a threat of extinction has appeared. He was hit by a pandemic, people die from unknown ailments, and some even become bloodthirsty and uncontrollable cannibals. The shamans of several tribes are trying desperately to create a medicine, but without success. Madness and despair have settled in the hearts of people, and in order to survive, they need to forget old grievances and rally in the face of danger.",
            "short_description": "HUNGER — a survival game about a soldier on an unexplored island. There are settlers there, but their civilization is on the brink of extinction: a pandemic, chaos, cannibals. The shamans are trying to create a cure, but to no avail. There is no salvation — madness has consumed the island.",
